<title>INDONESIA: Modern Bank 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Modern Bank 1996 net rises.</headline>
<text>
<p>JAKARTA, Feb 4 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		    Full year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  30.62  vs  22.22</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)	  255  vs    185</p>
<p>    Net interest income	    117.47    vs   73.48</p>
<p>    Other operating income	  19.29    vs   10.87</p>
<p>    Other operating expenses	91.90    vs   47.65</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  44.87    vs   36.71</p>
<p>    Pre-tax income		    45.07    vs   37.09</p>
<p>Note : The results were unaudited. PT Modern Bank is a medium-sized bank focusing on retail banking.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
